Wrote the label file: one row for Matt Lehman on `same-sex-marriage`, coded chair **5**. Basis: he co-authored HJR 3 (2014) and voted Yea on its House third reading (Roll Call 70, Jan 28 2014), an in-term record whose sole operative text — "Only a marriage between one (1) man and one (1) woman shall be valid or recognized as a marriage in Indiana" — matches rung 5 exactly, with no other rung's clause present.
